{"agent_id":"pp3g-7MKi-implement-the-orchestrator-role-for-the-ases-repo-gh","agent_seq":4,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T00:46:40.390931909Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"bdfe9151-dfb2-417c-a17c-8bee25fbb665","comment_uuid":"e68e3d51-bf03-40aa-8792-1c51f8c754aa","author":"pp3g-7MKi-implement-the-orchestrator-role-for-the-ases-repo-gh","content":"[action] Explored tripn-astro orchestrator.md + orchestrator-guard.ts, ASES hook-config by_type mechanism, plugin enforcement flow, opencode permission matcher semantics (wildcard ' *' matches bare+args), rtk rewrite behavior (git merge NOT rewritten, git commit→rtk git commit)","created_at":"2026-08-03T00:46:40.384037627Z","kind":"note","signed_by":"SHA256:/UuTUJGG6+tsE8ECeqs+b9NxiEC97clqkF/hd9Xet5g","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglkRqfirXDSrdmw8H+TObgdZfnJ6t3bsqH37fOPsdzi0AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAAHTkjo1mmA2mZRX1JRlytHjwcoekCyBNZtjHBgJTWtdlLOmYIXCseh8HByDM/OT0EAfHdOaFWmc3IF4eDwc3Dw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:/UuTUJGG6+tsE8ECeqs+b9NxiEC97clqkF/hd9Xet5g","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglkRqfirXDSrdmw8H+TObgdZfnJ6t3bsqH37fOPsdzi0AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBk+VBRlD5lr6A7HlyZfygvi1j94g/gc+6GDU6ZXvfzx1cXEnlp7UbAVCzxCoIZjQeTb67tkn2FaWd/tUrVL4wo="}
{"agent_id":"pp3g-7MKi-implement-the-orchestrator-role-for-the-ases-repo-gh","agent_seq":5,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T00:46:44.663049623Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"bdfe9151-dfb2-417c-a17c-8bee25fbb665","comment_uuid":"5cb5920d-7e33-41a7-8cb4-79163e498cfd","author":"pp3g-7MKi-implement-the-orchestrator-role-for-the-ases-repo-gh","content":"Plan: Port the orchestrator role from tripn-astro with the ASES git deviation.\n\n1. **.opencode/agents/orchestrator.md** — port from tripn-astro, adapted to ASES: coordination-only primary agent; edit deny; bash allowlist = crosslink *, opencode models *, read-only git (status/diff/log/show/branch) + the two GATED git commands (commit/merge — required so the plugin-level active-issue gate is reachable, since the opencode matcher runs after plugin hooks and would otherwise deny merge outright), ls/cat/rtk; task allowlist builder/reviewer/auditor; question allow; webfetch/websearch deny.\n\n2. **.opencode/plugins/orchestrator-guard.ts** — port verbatim from tripn-astro (blocks write/edit/apply_patch/filesystem_write_file/filesystem_edit_file for all non-Builder agents via tool.execute.before; tracks agent via chat.params).\n\n3. **.opencode/opencode.json** — register orchestrator (mode: primary), add orchestrator-guard.ts to plugin list (before crosslink-guard, mirroring tripn-astro).\n\n4. **.crosslink/hook-config.json** — add agent_overrides.by_type.orchestrator: blocked_git_commands = the shared blocked list minus git merge (push/rebase/reset/force/clean/checkout ./restore ./stash/tag/am/apply/branch -d/-D/-m all remain blocked); gated_git_commands = [git commit, git merge] (active issue required). reviewer/auditor entries unchanged (full git-write blocking).\n\n5. **docs/ORCHESTRATOR.md** — add the four-role permission matrix (orchestrator: commit+merge gated, push blocked; builder: full; reviewer/auditor: read-only), replace stale static model names with model-resolved-at-runtime notes.\n\n6. **SESSION-START.md** — add role-routing pointers for the four roles + the permission matrix.\n\n7. **.opencode/permissions.md** — create (does not exist), mirroring tripn-astro's snapshot structure with the ASES git rule for orchestrator.\n\n8. **.crosslink/knowledge/agent-orchestration-playbook.md + crosslink-fork.md** — update 'orchestrator does NOT merge' statements to the ASES rule (commit+merge gated, push blocked); document by_type.orchestrator.\n\nVerification: JSON validity, tsc check on plugins. Will NOT run opencode (this change alters the current session's own permissions — a restart is required for the orchestrator role to take effect, noted in the result comment).","created_at":"2026-08-03T00:46:44.656715175Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:/UuTUJGG6+tsE8ECeqs+b9NxiEC97clqkF/hd9Xet5g","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglkRqfirXDSrdmw8H+TObgdZfnJ6t3bsqH37fOPsdzi0AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAzSPa1sPxpyKoVOOByFukMgN5RaBLR1FGjluui23IhOS8DXcJOC2DEP65Jch39Nx5Hs9haxc8R5JoX+K52dXHAg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:/UuTUJGG6+tsE8ECeqs+b9NxiEC97clqkF/hd9Xet5g","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglkRqfirXDSrdmw8H+TObgdZfnJ6t3bsqH37fOPsdzi0AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFZM89tKg7u/l+9qmVflpNFwZP5FuNFJyPzzJg0IFeTgs+qJYesa1fTgtW0BBYmQj8qYx2lcHqqLrhCQA0dNMgw="}
{"agent_id":"pp3g-7MKi-implement-the-orchestrator-role-for-the-ases-repo-gh","agent_seq":6,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T00:50:26.934543068Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"bdfe9151-dfb2-417c-a17c-8bee25fbb665","comment_uuid":"8b556eeb-af4e-4220-bafc-0b7e8b1bf0af","author":"pp3g-7MKi-implement-the-orchestrator-role-for-the-ases-repo-gh","content":"[action] Committed ba3dabc: orchestrator role implemented. Discovery: rtk rewrite does NOT rewrite 'git merge' (stays plain) while 'git commit' becomes 'rtk git commit' — hence frontmatter must include 'git merge *' (and 'git commit *') for the plugin's active-issue gate to be reachable.","created_at":"2026-08-03T00:50:26.925647204Z","kind":"note","signed_by":"SHA256:/UuTUJGG6+tsE8ECeqs+b9NxiEC97clqkF/hd9Xet5g","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglkRqfirXDSrdmw8H+TObgdZfnJ6t3bsqH37fOPsdzi0AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAZmOJcNRb7SzZVhYbvW0jN0W9Rss8kpHWnXdVOGza9PXSjlYUGBM5iuvxJXTQSmziCfg3fV09JKZucj+r63VkDA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:/UuTUJGG6+tsE8ECeqs+b9NxiEC97clqkF/hd9Xet5g","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglkRqfirXDSrdmw8H+TObgdZfnJ6t3bsqH37fOPsdzi0AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAZYFbZzI88S7Rhi4XMWI8piOm4XMhzd6izurkLCwAf0qybhnExffFZVPhSqBfZv16q37BFyXs7MLFslSVq5Cg4="}
{"agent_id":"pp3g-7MKi-implement-the-orchestrator-role-for-the-ases-repo-gh","agent_seq":7,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T00:50:33.029576462Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"bdfe9151-dfb2-417c-a17c-8bee25fbb665","comment_uuid":"af216394-6440-49cd-b222-3a6e495603ac","author":"pp3g-7MKi-implement-the-orchestrator-role-for-the-ases-repo-gh","content":"Result: Orchestrator role implemented for ASES. Commit ba3dabc (9 files, +456/-12).\n\n**Deliverables**\n1. `.opencode/agents/orchestrator.md` — ported from tripn-astro, adapted to ASES: coordination-only primary agent; edit deny; bash allowlist = crosslink *, opencode models *, read-only git (status/diff/log/show/branch), ls/cat/rtk; task allowlist = builder/reviewer/auditor; question allow; webfetch/websearch deny. Includes the ASES git rule inline.\n2. `.opencode/plugins/orchestrator-guard.ts` — ported verbatim; blocks write/edit/apply_patch/filesystem_write_file/filesystem_edit_file for all non-Builder agents (closes OpenCode #33677 edit:deny gap).\n3. `.opencode/opencode.json` — orchestrator registered as primary agent; orchestrator-guard.ts added to plugin list (before crosslink-guard, mirroring tripn-astro).\n4. `.crosslink/hook-config.json` — added `agent_overrides.by_type.orchestrator`: blocked_git_commands = shared blocked list minus git merge (push/--force/-f, rebase, cherry-pick, reset, clean, checkout ., restore ., stash, tag, am, apply, branch -d/-D/-m); gated_git_commands = [git commit, git merge] (active issue required). Reviewer/auditor entries unchanged (full git-write blocking).\n5. `docs/ORCHESTRATOR.md` — added four-role permission matrix; replaced stale static model pins (Nemotron/Hy3/North Mini/Gemini) with model-resolved-at-runtime notes.\n6. `SESSION-START.md` — added §1b role-routing table + permission matrix.\n7. `.opencode/permissions.md` — created (mirrors tripn-astro's snapshot structure) with the ASES git-write rules summary.\n8. Knowledge: agent-orchestration-playbook.md (orchestrator merge is now gated, not a hard 'does NOT merge') + crosslink-fork.md (by_type.orchestrator documented).\n\n**Verification performed**: JSON validity; tsc typecheck (orchestrator-guard.ts and crosslink-guard.ts clean; only pre-existing rtk-guard Bun-global errors remain); simulation of both enforcement layers — opencode Wildcard matcher (frontmatter allowlist) and crosslink-guard blocked/gated matching (by_type.orchestrator) — 25 matcher cases + 25 git-rule cases all pass (commit/merge GATED, push/rebase/reset/clean/checkout ./restore ./stash/tag/am/apply/branch -d/-D/-m BLOCKED; reviewer/auditor unchanged).\n\n**Key discovery**: rtk rewrite does NOT rewrite `git merge` (stays plain) while `git commit` becomes `rtk git commit`. Because the OpenCode matcher runs after plugin hooks, the frontmatter must include `git commit *` and `git merge *` patterns so the commands reach the plugin's active-issue gate — otherwise the gate would be dead code and merge would be silently impossible. Documented in ORCHESTRATOR.md + permissions.md.\n\n**RESTART REQUIRED**: this change alters the current session's own agent permissions. The orchestrator role, the orchestrator-guard plugin, and the by_type.orchestrator override are read at session start — an OpenCode restart is required for the orchestrator role to take effect. I did not (and could not) verify the running behavior by launching opencode myself, per the task's explicit instruction.","created_at":"2026-08-03T00:50:33.021345463Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:/UuTUJGG6+tsE8ECeqs+b9NxiEC97clqkF/hd9Xet5g","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglkRqfirXDSrdmw8H+TObgdZfnJ6t3bsqH37fOPsdzi0AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAKj3E3BJhPJrxyvhORvMmJzLQNIg3JaW+fuWrI5oQCFknO78lKOG9AqM6X9C4Av4c8vUgWLEbQY5dnKk6rvDtCw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:/UuTUJGG6+tsE8ECeqs+b9NxiEC97clqkF/hd9Xet5g","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglkRqfirXDSrdmw8H+TObgdZfnJ6t3bsqH37fOPsdzi0AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQD+B66ssD0pVsp4+iBac00TWxPjUiuzT+CvP3ZyWBNIJkwWlzzd4K26l7MWk+ZvnC3WgRVJkIyQiADy8tVNsPQM="}
